  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&quot;The development objective of the project is to generate evidence
 on the impact of private provision of employment services for employers and jobseekers with a particular focus on youth and women, on employment outcomes and propose a menu of employment services to be delivered by either by public and or provate providers, based on this evidence.&quot;</narrative>
